 "notes": [
  "Post IHS Markit merger (closed 28-Feb-2022). Segments: MI, Ratings, Commodity Insights (CI), Mobility (MOB), Indices, Engineering Solutions (ES) + Equity in Income on Unconsolidated Subsidiaries line.",
  "Three-month 2022 column is 'Adjusted' (actual scope, excluding divested businesses: 'Divestitures' OP +1, NI +1); comparatives and nine-month figures are non-GAAP pro forma adjusted. Divestitures recorded per segment as 'divest' and in ngaap.items (cat OTHER).",
  "IS line 'Loss (gain) on dispositions' printed 2 = loss: gain_disp = -2 (MI loss 17 partly offset by Indices gain 14 and others).",
  "IS line '(Gain) loss on extinguishment of debt, net' printed (4) = gain of 4, kept in other_lines as +4 (income sign); EBT 823 = 853 + 37 - 71 + 4; check_rec 'op+oth-int = ebt' fails by 4 for this reason.",
  "Segment expense table total 2,008 vs IS expenses 2,012 (segment table nets disposition result and equity income).",
  "Rounding: MI items 37 vs printed 36; CI 24 vs 25; Mobility -18 vs -19 (Mobility 90 - 19 + 76 = 147 vs adj 146); Indices -12 vs -13 (239 - 13 + 9 = 235 vs adj 234); adjusted corporate 175 - 150 = 25 vs printed 24.",
  "Indices employee severance: three-month after-tax amount not printed separately ('$1 million and $4 million ($3 million after-tax)'), net omitted.",
  "New NCI adjustment (j): non-GAAP adjusted NCI 56 vs reported 70 \u2014 removes the JV partner's portion of the gain on disposition of the L100 Index (sale of LCD to Morningstar); recorded as item net +14 (add-back to NI attributable).",
  "Footnote after-tax items (incl. NCI +14 and divestitures +1) sum to 142 vs aggregate 144 + 1 = 145 (rounding and the missing Indices severance after-tax); 608 + 142 + 216 = 966 vs adjusted NI 968 (608 + 144 + 216 + 1 = 969 ~ 968).",
  "Indices adjusted operating profit attributable to the Company (Adjusted Indices net operating profit): 184 (adjusted NCI share 50).",
  "corp_nongaap / corp_deal_amort in add-back sign (reduce unallocated expense).",
  "cfpub nine months; capex and nci_dist recorded as positive outflows; adjusted FCF = 'Non-GAAP pro forma adjusted free cash flow excluding certain items'.",
  "rev_type is 'Adjusted revenue' by type (excludes divestitures; total 2,862 vs GAAP 2,861)."
 ],
